      <!-- Symmetric eight-thruster layout: h0-h3 horizontal, v0-v3 vertical.
           Rotor masses/inertias are deducted from base_link to preserve the
           neutral vehicle mass and original composite rigid-body inertia.
           Each command is a held, reversible force in N; the revolute axes
           are body-frame thrust directions, and their offsets generate torque. -->
      <link name="thruster_0_link">
